<description>pitch 7.6 mm from the sellers' listings and the common footprint BUZ-TH_BD12.0-P7.60; the owner measured about 8 mm with a ruler, which agrees within a ruler's reading. Drill 1.0 mm for legs of about 0.6 mm. The circle is the 12 mm body</description>
